{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}AC11.03 – LAN and VLAN Design{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="container">

        <h1>AC11.03 – Designing a LAN and Segmenting with VLANs</h1>
        <p><strong>Objective:</strong> Design a functional LAN and segment the network using VLANs for better organization and security.</p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Reflective Analysis</h2>
        <p>
            This activity allowed me to apply network theory to practical design.
            I learned to plan the network topology, assign VLANs, configure switches and routers,
            and test connectivity. It also reinforced the importance of network efficiency and security.
        </p>

        <h2>Evidence Documents</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Network diagram showing LAN topology and VLAN segmentation.</li>
            <li>Configuration screenshots of switches/routers with VLAN setup.</li>
            <li>Connectivity test results (ping tests between VLANs).</li>
            <li>Report listing VLANs, assigned devices, IP addresses, and observations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Illustrative Image</h2>
        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:10px;">
            <img src="{{ asset('images/ac1103.png') }}" alt="AC11.03 LAN Design" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;">
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:30px;">
